[en.FOCUS_C08_WASTELAND_ADVENTURE]
Wasteland Adventure

[en.FOCUS_C08_WASTELAND_ADVENTURE_desc]
Looking east, between the blizzard and the mountains, is a wasteland where almost no pony lives. Ever since Starlight Glimmer escaped through the cave years ago, not a single other pony from Our Town has visited there. Well, to be fair, a few ponies from the other side of the cave occasionally come to Our Town for trade, but the ponies of Our Town have no way of knowing what’s going on over there.\n\nSince the climate turned cold, the blizzard has almost closed the road to the other side. The last time the ponies from the other side came to Our Town was three years ago. What happened on the other side of the cave? It’s time to find out.

[en.FOCUS_C08_WASTELAND_ADVENTURE_TOOLTIP]
Explore the §gWasteland§! and prepare for taking over this place\nUnlock decision in §YStarlight Radio§!: §YTake Over the Wasteland§!

[zh.FOCUS_C08_WASTELAND_ADVENTURE]
荒地探险

[zh.FOCUS_C08_WASTELAND_ADVENTURE_desc]
向东望去，透过暴雪与山脉的一线之间，便是近乎无小马居住的荒地。在当年星光熠熠通过山洞逃跑后，就再也没有平等镇的小马到过那里，除了偶然有几只山洞那头的小马来到平等镇进行贸易外，平等镇的小马们就没有什么渠道了解那边究竟是什么情况了。\n\n自从天气变冷后，暴雪几乎封闭了通向另一头的道路。那一头的小马们上一次来平等镇的时间是三年之前，山洞另一边究竟发生了什么？是时候一探究竟了。

[zh.FOCUS_C08_WASTELAND_ADVENTURE_TOOLTIP]
探索§g荒地§!，为以后接管这里做准备\n解锁§Y星光电台§!中的决议：§Y接管荒地§!

